      "problem": "Given that $X \\sim \\textrm{Bernoulli}(0.55),$ compute $P(X = 1                                                                                                                                                                                           \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                  ).$",
      "worked_solution": "If $X \\sim \\textrm{Bernoulli}(p),$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function: \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14273447/assets/e632cac9fd66ba5b692ea59db696cea770a1216eda0634bebc4517f4b453fc22.svg)\n\nHere, $X \\sim \\textrm{Bernoulli}(0.55),$ so the distribution of $X$ in this case is\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14273447/assets/ba222baecd51e1f0fc145934a8f82970ef556b5a95d935df1c728cf7af67f5e9.svg)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nP(X = 1) = f(1) = 0.55.\n$$",
